<title>USA: PHLX to list Aware options on Feb 10.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Aware options on Feb 10.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange said Wednesday it would begin trading options on shares of Aware Inc on February 10.</p>
<p>The options would have opening strike prices of 7-1/2, 10 and 12-1/2, with initial expirations in February, March, April and July, the exchange said. Position limits of 7,500 contracts have been set.</p>
<p>Group One Ltd was named the specialist unit for the options.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
